== Examples ==
=== Song of the Dragonborn ===
The first text in the Dragon Alphabet appeared in a [http://www.gameinformer.com/b/news/archive/2011/01/06/february-cover-revealedesv-the-elder-scrolls-v-skyrim.aspx ''Game Informer'' post] about their February 2011 edition, along with a post about [http://www.gameinformer.com/b/news/archive/2011/01/06/translating-the-cover.aspx translating the cover]. The original article contained the following samples of Dragon text:

