Coincidentally, this poem is also the song that is heard throughout the game when the player enters combat with a dragon or if the player lets the game run on the main menu without selecting an option.

Originally known as "Dragon Poem", it was revealed through the in-game book ''[[Skyrim:Songs_of_Skyrim|Songs of Skyrim]]'' that this is only a portion of a longer work. Loading Screen text name the work ''Song of the Dragonborn''. The full version, in both English and the Dragon Tongue, can be found in ''Songs of Skyrim''.

