===Legends Card Packs===
[[File:LG-misc-Skyrim Legendary Pack.jpg|thumb|right|Skyrim Legendary card pack]]
[[LG:Heroes of Skyrim|Heroes of Skyrim]] Legendary card packs in [[Legends:Legends|''The Elder Scrolls: Legends'']] feature the Dragon Alphabet, but it is used to replace English characters rather than words in the Dragon Language. Legendary packs display the following phrases:
{|class=wikitable {{AL|C}}
!Dragon alphabet
!Latin alphabet
|-
|{{DragonFont|WALK IN THE PA OF THE LEGENDS|5}}
|WALK IN THE PA[TH] OF THE LEGENDS
|-
|{{DragonFont|UNLEASH THE STRENGTH OF LEGENDS AND CONQUER ALL|5}}
|UNLEASH THE STRENGTH OF LEGENDS AND CONQUER ALL
|-
|{{DragonFont|THE POWER OF LEGENDS AWAITS YOU|5}}
|THE POWER OF LEGENDS AWAITS YOU
|}
This is the only instance of the letter "C" in the Dragon Alphabet.

